sequenceDiagram
    participant DSP as DSP Operator
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant WFC as Workflow Controller<br/>6060/TCP Health
    participant StepPod as Step Pod<br/>(argoexec sidecar)
    participant ArgoSrv as Argo Server<br/>2746/TCP gRPC+HTTP
    participant Client as API Client

    Note over DSP,K8s: Pipeline Submission Flow
    DSP->>K8s: Create Workflow CR<br/>(argoproj.io/v1alpha1)
    K8s-->>WFC: Watch notification<br/>Workflow created
    WFC->>K8s: Create Step Pod<br/>with argoexec sidecar
    K8s-->>WFC: Pod scheduled
    StepPod->>K8s: Create WorkflowTaskResult CR<br/>on step completion
    K8s-->>WFC: TaskResult watch event
    WFC->>K8s: Update Workflow status
    WFC->>K8s: Create PodDisruptionBudget<br/>for running workflow pods

    Note over Client,ArgoSrv: API Access Flow
    Client->>ArgoSrv: gRPC/HTTP request<br/>Port 2746
    ArgoSrv->>ArgoSrv: Gatekeeper intercept<br/>Authenticate request
    alt Client Mode
        ArgoSrv->>K8s: Delegate bearer token<br/>User-impersonated ops
    else Server Mode
        ArgoSrv->>K8s: Use server SA<br/>Service account auth
    else SSO Mode
        ArgoSrv->>ArgoSrv: Validate OIDC token<br/>Map to namespace SA
    end
    ArgoSrv-->>Client: gRPC/HTTP response

    Note over Client,ArgoSrv: Artifact Retrieval
    Client->>ArgoSrv: GET /artifacts/{namespace}/{workflow}/{nodeId}/{artifactName}
    ArgoSrv->>ArgoSrv: Gatekeeper auth check
    ArgoSrv-->>Client: Artifact content

    Note over WFC,K8s: Resource Management
    WFC->>K8s: CRUD ConfigMaps<br/>(memoization cache)
    WFC->>K8s: Read Secrets<br/>(SSO configuration)
    WFC->>K8s: SelfSubjectAccessReview<br/>(authorization verification)

    Note over WFC: Observability
    WFC->>WFC: /healthz on port 6060
    ArgoSrv->>ArgoSrv: /metrics (Prometheus)
    ArgoSrv->>ArgoSrv: /debug/pprof/ (profiling)
